 "remarks": "You can change countertops and flooring...BUT finding a property in Norwalk with this much outdoor space? That's something RARE!! This ranch-style home comes with something unusual - LAND!!! .66 lot - flat, clear and open, which gives buyers a blank canvas to create a stunning backyard oasis! The inside is also a buyer's blank canvas with its open floor living room and dining area, eat-in kitchen with island, wood burning fireplace, oversized bay window and beautiful hardwood floors. Sunny room off of the kitchen is perfect for a home office or playroom! Expansive deck serves as an extension of the home and overlooks the picturesque landscaping of this massive yard. Driveway leads to a 2-car garage and a laundry/drop zone before entering into additional lower level living space with a wood-burning fireplace. It is a great space for a Family Room, Home Office or a Private In-Law Suite. The main floor also includes 3 bedrooms and 2 full baths. New Roof (2 yrs old), Crown Molding and Hallway Built-Ins add charm and character. Starlight Drive is a quiet, tree-lined neighborhood which borders Westport town line and is a short drive to shops, restaurants, theater and gym. Easy access to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway. It is the perfect place to make your own and call YOUR HOME!",
